  24:     - The grid uses teal as the dominant background and black for one or more
  25:       5x5 regions.
  26:     - Each black region has a black one-pixel border and a 3x3 interior that
  27:       may already contain teal pixels.
  28: 
  29:     Rule
  30:     - Overlay the legend 1 7 6 / 4 8 5 / 2 9 3 on the 3x3 interior of every
  31:       5x5 black region.
  32:     - Wherever an interior non-center legend position is still black, recolor it
  33:       to the corresponding legend color; leave existing teal pixels, the center,
  34:       and the black border unchanged.
